\end{align*}
where the final inequality follows from the definition of $\tau_N$ and Lemma \ref{thm:sumprod1}\ref{thm:sumprod1_a}, and tracking the event $\{c_N(s) \leq t - s\}$ is necessary in case of a large negative value of the lower bound $t - s - c_N(\tau_N(s))$ when $l$ is even.
