        \exp[ \alpha_n 1_N (t+1) (1+B_n^\prime) ] \Bigg\}
        \sum_{\substack{r_1 <\dots< r_k :\\ r_i \leq \tau_N(t_i) \forall i}}
        \prod_{i=1}^k p_{r_i} \\
    &\phantom{\leq} + \exp[ \alpha_n 1_N (1 + B_n^\prime) (t+1) ]
