        \sum_{l=0}^{\tau_N(t)} (\alpha_n)^l 1_N \frac{1}{l!} t^l \\
    &\phantom{\leq}+ \Bigg\{ c_N(\tau_N(t)) 
        \exp[ \alpha_n 1_N (t+1) ]  + \Bigg( \sum_{s=1}^{\tau_N(t)} c_N(s)^2 \Bigg)
