We will also need an upper bound on this product, which is formed from \eqref{eq:021} with a further deterministic bound:
\begin{align}
\prod_{r=1}^{\tau_N(t)}  (1-p_r)
\leq & \sum_{l=0}^{\tau_N(t)} (-\alpha_n)^l 1_N \frac{1}{l!} t^l \1{E_N^1 \cap E_N^2}
        + c_N(\tau_N(t)) \exp[ \alpha_n 1_N (t+1) ] \notag\\
    & + \Bigg( \sum_{s=1}^{\tau_N(t)} c_N(s)^2 \Bigg)
