        ( t_j +1 )^{i_j - i_{j-1}} \Bigg\} \1{E_N^4} \\
&= \sum_{\mathcal{I} \subseteq [k]} (-1)^{k-|\mathcal{I}|} 
        \Bigg( \prod_{j\in\mathcal{I}} \frac{(t_j - t_{j-1})^{i_j - i_{j-1}}}
        {(i_j - i_{j-1})!} \Bigg) \\
    &\phantom{\geq \prod_{j=1}^k \Bigg\{} \times \Bigg( \prod_{j\notin\mathcal{I}} \Bigg( c_N(\tau_N(t_{j - 1})) +
